package CanvasNet {
    part def ScaleResolver {
        doc /* The internal static ScaleResolver with the ResolvedScales, ResolvedScale, and RangeEnd types: it infers, for each encoding channel of a single view, the scale Vega-Lite would build, as a description that is independent of the size of the data rectangle until ResolvedScale.CreateModel is given it. Rules (ported from Vega-Lite and Vega with attribution): quantitative positions are linear and discrete positions are band scales for rect, bar, image, rule, and tick marks and point scales otherwise; color, fill, and stroke fields are ordinal (tableau10 or the configured scheme, with a recorded fallback for other schemes); size and opacity use the default ranges of the mark; the linear domain is the extent of the valid values with the zero rule, an explicit domain (all entries kept, so a domain and range of more than two entries map piecewise; zero, padding, and nice change only the end entries), nice, and pixel padding applied in Vega's order; a band or point scale uses the first two entries of its range; a discrete domain is sorted ascending by default (sort may be ascending, descending, null, an array, or - Phase 5 - an object with an op of count, sum, mean, average, median, min, or max, an optional field, and an optional order, which orders the categories by that aggregate over the rows of the transformed table, stably, a category without a valid number first except for sum and count, via IsSupportedFieldSort and SortByField); paddings follow the mark and the scale configuration; a step-driven discrete scale reports the extent the view needs; InferOrient gives the horizontal or vertical orientation of bar, tick, and rule marks. An invalid scale domain or range is a VegaLiteSpecException with the pointer, a discrete domain beyond MaxScaleDomainSize is a VegaLiteRenderException, and cancellation is polled while the data is scanned. */

        comment sourceRef /* Source: src/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite/Scales/ScaleResolver.cs */
        comment testRef /* Test: test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/Scales/ScaleResolverTests.cs, test/DemaConsulting.CanvasNet.VegaLite.Tests/Transforms/RowTransformsTests.cs (the sort-by-field tests) */
        comment designRef /* Design: docs/design/canvas-net-vega-lite/scales/scale-resolver.md */
        comment verificationRef /* Verification: docs/verification/canvas-net-vega-lite/scales/scale-resolver.md */
        comment reqRef /* Requirements: docs/reqstream/canvas-net-vega-lite/scales/scale-resolver.yaml */
    }
}
